---

<Base
  title="About · Freelance SAP HCM Payroll and ECP consultant"
  description="Background, certifications and skills of Facundo Corbalan, senior SAP HCM Payroll and SuccessFactors Employee Central Payroll consultant based in Madrid."
  lang="en"
  active="about"
  esPath="/sobre-mi/"
  enPath="/en/about/"
>
  <section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:32px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Eight years looking at payroll from the inside</h1>
      <p class="lead narrow">
        I started running payroll by hand in Buenos Aires and ended up designing the systems that calculate it for tens
        of thousands of people. That path, from operations to design, is what lets me find the root of a problem
        quickly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p>
        I am a senior consultant specialised in SAP HCM Payroll and SAP SuccessFactors Employee Central Payroll, with
        more than eight years on implementation, evolution and support projects for large, operationally complex
        organisations in Spain, Portugal, Argentina and Latin America.
      </p>
      <p>
        Payroll is my core specialisation, complemented by the design of integrations between Employee Central and ECP:
        data model, replication and end-to-end EC to ECP processes. On the technical side I work with payroll-related
        ABAP to analyse, debug and specify developments — calculation functions, BADIs, interfaces and Z-reports — and
        to coordinate them with the team that builds them. What I care about is a solution that is robust and
        maintainable, and risks that surface early, while they are still cheap to fix.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have seen the payroll cycle from several angles: operations technician, key user on a Nexus HR to PeopleSoft
        migration, SAP functional consultant, and in-house owner of a global payroll operation covering eight countries
        at Tenaris. I have lived in Madrid since 2023 and work remotely, with occasional in-person meetings.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Active certifications</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:24px">
        {certifications.map((c) => (
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{c.t}</h3>
            <p class="small muted">{c.d}</p>
            <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:0">
              <a href={c.badge} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify on Credly →</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <ul class="tags" style="margin-top:20px">
        {skills.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Background</h2>
      <div class="timeline" style="margin-top:32px">
        {background.map((b) => (
          <div class="item">
            <div class="when">{b.when}</div>
            <h3>{b.role}</h3>
            <div class="small muted" style="margin-bottom:8px">{b.where}</div>
            <p class="muted" style="margin:0">{b.d}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-soft tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Education</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:24px">
        {education.map((e) => (
          <div class="card">
            <h3>{e.t}</h3>
            <p class="small muted">{e.d}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Professional profiles</h2>
      <p class="muted narrow">
        You can also verify my track record on{' '}
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/facundocorbalan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>{' '}
        and my freelance activity on{' '}
        <a href="https://www.malt.es/profile/facundocorbalan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Malt</a>, where I hold
        Supermalter status.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta">
        <h2>Shall we work together?</h2>
        <p class="muted narrow" style="margin:0 auto 24px">
          I am available for implementation projects, audits and support, either with end clients or through partners.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
